# DDR 2ndMIX Link Ver. (System 573, analog I/O board): from what ddr2mla-install.his
# left, with the game CD: the flash check, the title, then two coins (one credit), Start through the
# title, mode select and How To Play, song select (BOYS), the song stepped on all four panels every 8 frames until it fails. Hashes the main RAM every frame, snapshots every
# 60 frames.
game ddr2mla

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 7800 press "Coin 1" 8
at 7840 press "Coin 1" 8
at 8000 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 8600 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 9200 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 9800 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 10100 every 8 press "P1 Left" 4
from 10100 every 8 press "P1 Down" 4
from 10100 every 8 press "P1 Up" 4
from 10100 every 8 press "P1 Right" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 15000 quit
